<title>USA: TABLE - Central Maine Power Co Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Central Maine Power Co Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Maine 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.15   profit	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,539   profit	 9,096</p>
<p> Revs		     210,074		  216,358</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,443		   32,443</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.86   profit	 $1.45</p>
