<p> Revs		     954,990		  940,617</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,443		   32,443</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income prior to the payment of preferred dividends. Q2 preferred dividends: $2.2 million vs $2.5 million. 12 month preferred dividends $8.8 million vs $10.1 million.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 results hurt by outages at Maine Yankee nuclear plant.</p>
